enarios</strong> \u2013 Each with its own chilling atmosphere and unexpected horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARBACENA ASYLUM</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORGAN'S HOUSE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WITCH FOREST</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709940/extras/b6f07ef300aaa57eb520d1bef549e956.webp?t=1744102957\" width=600 height=35 /></span>\ud83d\udeb6 <strong>A true walking simulator</strong> \u2013 No puzzles, no interactions\u2014just you, the darkness, and whatever lurks within\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play alone. Lights off. Stay quiet\u2026 or face the consequences.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709940/extras/d6f7cef6b73cdacb7a9a3b2ae940e804.poster.avif?t=1744102957\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709940/extras/d6f7cef6b73cdacb7a9a3b2ae940e804.webm?t=1744102957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709940/extras/d6f7cef6b73cdacb7a9a3b2ae940e804.mp4?t=1744102957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709940/extras/7786e0a9b931799a1e255b4a37609d58.avif?t=1744102957\" width=600 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared